ing up Candidate B as a strong alternative. So we can say we think Candidate B might be a better fit, given reliability and stress handling, and that his communication issue is less severe than C's egocentric attitude.\n\nThus our vote could be Candidate B. Provide reasoning.\n\nWe must output PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote.\n\nLet's craft."}
